        "Reference/shared/runtime/unknown contract/schema/fencing failure rejects restricted opener too and retains original duties/reservations",
        "Missing shared current quote is explicitly outside candidate-only; no unreviewed no-quote settlement capability is granted",
        "Existing apply_fill and paired matcher remain pre-confirmation local authorization with rollback, not an external confirmed-fill ingestion endpoint",
        "Reference-only replay is labelled incomplete shadow evidence, not full shadow success"
      ],
      "still_required_before_D2": [
        "Implement exact known-contract authority partition and immutable expected anchors without trusting mutated candidate objects or current defaults",
        "Implement authorized durable obligation source, two-sided exactly-once settlement, reservation/fee/position/ledger links and restricted opener",
        "Prove candidate failure cannot invoke candidate audit-after or block reference recovery while all reference/shared failures remain rejected",
        "Inject failures and reopen/unknown outcomes with complete original obligation/query evidence; preserve normal Credit V2 and funding/capability rejection boundaries"
      ],
