      ],
      "clarified": [
        "Persist EVALUATING intent independently before this command candidate check/dual compute; no financial transaction if intent not durable",
        "Exclusive account lane and local latch prevent next queued new-risk selection while intent exists",
        "Successful receipt/reservation/account effects and EVALUATING->OPEN share the financial commit",
